msgid ""
"By default during the validation of an invoice, an asset is created by "
"invoice line as long as an accounting entry is created by invoice line. With "
"this setting, an accounting entry will be created by product item. So, there "
"will be an asset by product item."
msgstr ""
"Som standard oprettes der et aktiv pr. fakturalinje ved validering af en "
"faktura, så længe der oprettes en bogføringspost pr. fakturalinje. Med denne "
"indstilling oprettes en bogføringspost pr. produktvare. Dermed vil der være "
"et aktiv pr. produktvare."

